==== Packaged ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If this parameter is true, then the tooltip of the item will display the number of calories, lipids, proteins and carbohydrates.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
Packaged = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
